 "brief": "Settlers backed by Israeli occupation forces attacked the Ar-Ras neighborhood in Hebron early Sunday morning, Shehab Wire reported. Two Palestinians sustained gunshot wounds from live ammunition, while eight others were injured during beatings administered by the attackers. The assault took place in the southern occupied West Bank city.\n\nIsraeli troops provided security for the settlers throughout the operation, according to the report. The incident marks another instance of settler violence in the area, where Palestinians have faced repeated attacks accompanied by Israeli military presence and protection of the assailants.",
